          "The risk around usage report is not that staff forget a task; it is that the record can look complete even when the health score note was never checked against the health dashboard. If the destination record is wrong, the team may send a correct-looking update while account executive still sees the old value in the health dashboard. Treat the usage report as a closed loop rather than a message: every action needs a source, a boundary, a destination, and a time. The risk is highest when the health dashboard looks current but the health score note behind it was never opened."
